# Editor-local state the C3 editor regenerates when it opens the project. These
# are genuinely not project content, so they are intentionally excluded from the
# canonical fixture.
*.uistate.json
uistate

# NOTE: `ts-defs` deliberately does NOT belong here. The SDK `ts-defs/` tree is
# declared fixture coverage (see README.md) and consumers such as construct3-chef
# need those declaration files present to resolve TypeScript symbols. It was
# previously listed above, which contradicted both the README and the 56 files
# already tracked against the rule, and forced every regenerated declaration file
# to be force-added. Do not re-add it.
